File name: <36 paths and 4 loops>
Path description: Dragon's Teeth Hills and Black Orc area bundle.
Path starts: N/A
Path ends: N/A
Area of the game: Module 1 and 5.
Level recommendation: N/A
Type of path: Both
File format: New
Monsters encountered: unsure.
Additional information:

This bundle of paths covers the crumbling tunnels, black orc area, and
a small area of the dragon's teeth hills. It has paths to the room
containing roots for the module 5 quest, to the dragon's teeth hills via
the crumbling tunnels (ie no skiff or rusty iron key required) and paths
to navigate the areas mention above. It is *highly* recommended that if
you want to use some of the paths in this bundle, you add ALL of them to
MegaMud, because adding only some paths will result in orphaned rooms
(ie custom rooms with no paths going to or from them).

Also included are loops for the northern section of the Dragon's Teeth
Hills, crumbling tunnels and black orc area.
